 ## Appendix
 
+::: {.callout-tip icon="false" title="Further reading"}
+
+- @weitz2024-acrobat report results of the **ACROBAT 2022 Challenge** on improving accuracy and robustness of alignment/registration across 4,212 histopathology whole-slide images (WSIs), and review various image registration methods using feature detection algorithms, particularly deep learning-based architectures.
+
+- Several benchmarks compare spatial alignment methods across a large selection of technologies [e.g., @Hu2024-benchmark-clustering; @Dong2025-benchmark]. Most recently, @Yan2026-benchmark-alignment compared 11 methods across 240 tissue sections from 14 technologies.
+
+- 10x Genomics' [Xenium explorer tutorial](https://www.10xgenomics.com/support/software/xenium-explorer/latest/tutorials/xe-image-alignment)
+and Bruker's [CosMx analysis scratch space](https://nanostring-biostats.github.io/CosMx-Analysis-Scratch-Space/index.html#category=alignment)
+provide instructions how to perform spatial alignment for these data.
+
+:::
